*~

# Local project data and credentials are never extension runtime files
**/.gitleaf/**
**/.gitleafignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db

# Exclude devDependencies
node_modules/typescript/**
node_modules/@esbuild/**
node_modules/@typescript-eslint/**
node_modules/eslint/**
node_modules/@types/**
node_modules/@eslint/**
node_modules/@eslint-community/**
node_modules/patch-package/**
node_modules/esbuild/**

# The Linux release targets glibc; Alpine/musl is not a published target
node_modules/@napi-rs/keyring-linux-*-musl/**

# Reduce node_modules size
**/node_modules/**/test/**
**/node_modules/**/tests/**
**/node_modules/**/test.js
**/node_modules/**/test-*.js
**/node_modules/**/example/**
**/node_modules/**/*.md
**/node_modules/**/*.markdown
**/node_modules/**/CHANGELOG*
**/node_modules/**/HISTORY*
**/node_modules/**/.travis.yml
**/node_modules/**/.eslintrc*
**/node_modules/**/.nycrc
**/node_modules/**/.github/**
**/node_modules/**/tsconfig.json
**/node_modules/**/*.d.ts
**/node_modules/**/.editorconfig

# Preserve third-party license and attribution files, including Markdown variants
!**/node_modules/**/LICENSE*
!**/node_modules/**/LICENCE*
!**/node_modules/**/NOTICE*
!**/node_modules/**/COPYING*
